title: "The Erdos Minimum-Overlap Constant Exceeds 0.38055925"
type: software
abstract: "A new center certificate, checked by separately implemented Arb and MPFI verifiers, combines with a replay of Price's original checker on 170 noncentral bins to establish c_E > 0.38055925."
